<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis (Bicyclus anynana & Junonia coenia (Nymphalidae: Satyrinae / Nymphalinae))",
        "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Bicyclus anynana & Junonia coenia (Nymphalidae: Satyrinae / Nymphalinae) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-4> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Bicyclus anynana & Junonia coenia (Nymphalidae: Satyrinae / Nymphalinae) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 47.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py> ;
    schema:about "Bicyclus anynana & Junonia coenia (Nymphalidae: Satyrinae / Nymphalinae)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py; output: docs/media/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings_comparison.png; organism: Bicyclus anynana & Junonia coenia (Nymphalidae: Satyrinae / Nymphalinae); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 0a2086f2436043ce9998603ef36e23feb6c621834d7d960a99310b296156772b; artifact_sha256: 6ecb6d8e0b918529a896cdbe3567e958ca7f94bdb3dfb0c94623949819152591; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/bicyclus_anynana_eyespot_specimen.jpg=f1826cee44602782..., datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings_reference.json=b19590626bdaff79..., datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/scout_manifest.json=7cfe9d2221ea5b8b...}" ;
